$ /opt/anaconda3/envs/mogp-drug/bin/python run_benchmark_seeds.py --help

quality_filter: PAINS catalog loaded; synthesizability metric = SA_Score (reject SA > 6.0) [SA_Score (MorganGenerator shim)].
usage: run_benchmark_seeds.py [-h] [--seeds SEEDS [SEEDS ...]]
                              [--lib-size LIB_SIZE] [--n-init N_INIT]
                              [--batch-size BATCH_SIZE]
                              [--n-iterations N_ITERATIONS]
                              [--mogp-iters MOGP_ITERS]
                              [--output-dir OUTPUT_DIR]
                              [--band {std,sem,ci95}] [--no-cache]
                              [--clear-cache] [--densify]
                              [--densify-per-parent DENSIFY_PER_PARENT]
                              [--densify-max-pool DENSIFY_MAX_POOL]

Multi-seed benchmark of MOGP vs baselines with mean±std aggregation.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --seeds SEEDS [SEEDS ...]
                        Random seeds; every method is run once per seed.
  --lib-size LIB_SIZE   Library pull size (built once, shared by all runs).
  --n-init N_INIT
  --batch-size BATCH_SIZE
  --n-iterations N_ITERATIONS
  --mogp-iters MOGP_ITERS
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
  --band {std,sem,ci95}
                        Shaded band on the curves: 'std' = ±1 std (default,
                        back-compat), 'sem' = ±1 standard error, 'ci95' = 95%
                        CI (mean ± 1.96·sem). sem/ci95 are more honest for few
                        seeds (they shrink as seeds are added, whereas std
                        does not).
  --no-cache            Disable the persistent docking cache for this run.
  --clear-cache         Wipe the docking cache before running (retry
                        failures).
  --densify             Enable Pareto-front analog densification in the MOGP
                        loop (the baselines are unaffected). Lets you quantify
                        the hypervolume gain from densification with error
                        bars across seeds.
  --densify-per-parent DENSIFY_PER_PARENT
                        Target analogs generated per front molecule.
  --densify-max-pool DENSIFY_MAX_POOL
                        Cap the total MOGP library size after densification.
